<title>USA: 3-D Geophysical to file 4 mln share offer.</title>
<headline>3-D Geophysical to file 4 mln share offer.</headline>
<dateline>ENGLEWOOD, Colo. 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>3-D Geophysical Inc said Wednesday it proposes to file for an underwritten public offering of about four million shares.</p>
<p>It gave no details.</p>
</text>
